{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu21", "cards": [{"id": "u2.t.evolution", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">ev<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">LU<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"evolution\" data-audio=\"audio/evolution.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: evolution\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"evolution\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"58.2\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Generation<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"67.4\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">1<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"58.2\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Generation<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"67.4\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">2<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"53.6\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Generation<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"62.8\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">3 (traits<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">shifted)<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Change in the inherited traits of a population over many generations.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>演化<\/b>：一个种群的遗传性状经过许多代而发生的改变。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">e-volve = &quot;unroll&quot;: the story of life unrolls over time.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">evolve = 展开：生命的故事随时间展开。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Does one individual evolve, or does a population?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">A population. Individuals do not evolve.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.trait", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">TRAIT<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"trait\" data-audio=\"audio/trait.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: trait\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"trait\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"90\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Trait<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">fur colour<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"34\" width=\"90\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Trait<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">beak size<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A characteristic of an organism, such as fur colour or beak size.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>性状<\/b>：生物的某个特征，如毛色或喙的大小。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">trait = Latin tractus, a drawn line or stroke: one feature of how you are drawn.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">trait 来自拉丁语 tractus（一笔、一道线）：你身上的一个特征。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Give one example of a trait.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Eye colour, height, beak shape, leaf size, and so on.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.variation", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">var<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">i<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">A<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"variation\" data-audio=\"audio/variation.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: variation\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"variation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"40\" cy=\"45\" rx=\"16\" ry=\"10\" class=\"f1\"/><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"45\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"14\" class=\"f2\"/><ellipse cx=\"160\" cy=\"45\" rx=\"12\" ry=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">same species, different sizes<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The differences in traits among individuals of the same species.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>变异<\/b>：同一物种个体之间性状的差别。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">vary = to differ. Without variation, natural selection has nothing to choose from.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">没有变异，自然选择就没东西可选。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Why is variation needed for natural selection?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Selection can only favour traits that already differ among individuals.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.mutation", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">mu<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">TA<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"mutation\" data-audio=\"audio/mutation.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: mutation\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"mutation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"58.2\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">DNA<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"67.4\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">...ATGC...<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Copying<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">error<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"58.2\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">DNA<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"67.4\" font-size=\"8.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">...ATCC...<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A change in the DNA sequence. It is the original source of new alleles.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>突变<\/b>：DNA 序列发生的改变，是新等位基因的最初来源。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">mutate = to change. Typo in the DNA.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">mutate = 改变：DNA 里的「错别字」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What is the original source of new alleles?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Mutation.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.heritable-trait", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">HER<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">it<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">a<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ble<\/span> <span class=\"st\">TRAIT<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"heritable trait\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: heritable trait\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"heritable trait\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Parent<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">genes<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Passed<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">on<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"58.05\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Offspring<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"68.25\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">trait<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A trait that parents pass to offspring through their genes.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>可遗传性状<\/b>：亲代通过基因传给后代的性状。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">heir = inheritor. A heritable trait can be inherited.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">heritable = 可被继承的。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Can a scar from an injury be passed on to offspring?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. It is not caused by genes, so it is not heritable.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.allele", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">al<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">LELE<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"allele\" data-audio=\"audio/allele.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: allele\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"allele\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"160\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f7\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"33\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">same gene, same spot<\/text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"50\" width=\"60\" height=\"24\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">allele A<\/text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"50\" width=\"60\" height=\"24\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">allele a<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">two versions of one gene<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">One version of a gene.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>等位基因<\/b>：同一个基因的不同版本。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">allele ~ &quot;other form&quot;. Gene = recipe, allele = one version of the recipe.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">基因 = 菜谱，等位基因 = 这份菜谱的不同版本。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What do we call different versions of the same gene?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Alleles.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.gene-pool", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">GENE<\/span> <span class=\"st\">POOL<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"gene pool\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: gene pool\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"gene pool\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"84\" ry=\"48\" class=\"f5 d\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"50\" r=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"70\" r=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"45\" r=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"72\" r=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"85\" r=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"55\" r=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"90\" r=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">all alleles of a population<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">All the alleles found in all the members of a population.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>基因库<\/b>：一个种群全部个体所携带的全部等位基因。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Pool = everything swimming in one place.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">pool = 汇聚在一起的全部东西。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What does the gene pool of a population contain?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">All of its alleles.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.allele-frequency", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">al<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">LELE<\/span> <span class=\"st\">FRE<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">quen<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">cy<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"allele frequency\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: allele frequency\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"allele frequency\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"100\" class=\"\"/><rect x=\"45\" y=\"40\" width=\"40\" height=\"60\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f1\"/><rect x=\"115\" y=\"70\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Gen 1: A = 60%<\/text><text x=\"135\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Gen 5: A = 30%<\/text><line x1=\"90.0\" y1=\"55.0\" x2=\"112.0\" y2=\"70.0\"/><polygon points=\"112.0,70.0 107.1,69.3 109.5,65.7\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">How common an allele is in a population, as a percentage.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>等位基因频率<\/b>：某个等位基因在种群中所占的比例。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Frequency = how often. Evolution at its smallest = frequency changes.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">频率 = 出现得多频繁；演化最小的表现就是频率变化。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: If allele A is found in 30 of 100 copies, what is its frequency?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">30%.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.natural-selection", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">NAT<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">u<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ral<\/span> <span class=\"sy\">se<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">LEC<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"natural selection\" data-audio=\"audio/natural-selection.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: natural selection\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"natural selection\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"63.15\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Variation<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"58.425\" font-size=\"6.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Better-suited<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"66.125\" font-size=\"6.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">breed more<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Their<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">traits<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">spread<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Individuals with traits that suit their environment survive and reproduce more, so those traits become more common.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>自然选择<\/b>：性状更适应环境的个体存活和繁殖得更多，这些性状在种群中越来越常见。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Nature does the selecting. Four steps: variation, inheritance, overproduction, differential survival.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">大自然来「选」：变异、遗传、过量繁殖、存活差异。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Does natural selection change individuals or populations?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Populations. It changes which traits are common.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u2.t.fitness", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">FIT<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ness<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"fitness\" data-audio=\"audio/fitness.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: fitness\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"fitness\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">High fitness<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"8.834586466165414\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">survives and leaves<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">many offspring<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Low fitness<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">leaves few or no<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">offspring<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">How well an organism survives and reproduces compared with others of its kind.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>适合度<\/b>：生物与同类相比，存活并繁殖后代的成功程度。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">In biology &quot;fit&quot; means &quot;leaves more offspring&quot;, not &quot;strong&quot;.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">生物学里 fit = 留下更多后代，不是「强壮」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Is the strongest animal always the fittest?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">No. Fitness is about leaving offspring.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u2.t.evolution", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Change in the inherited traits of a population over many generations.”<\/i>", "opts": ["analogous structure", "evolution", "coevolution", "bottleneck effect"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>evolution<\/b>: Change in the inherited traits of a population over many generations. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">演化<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.trait", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A characteristic of an organism, such as fur colour or beak size.”<\/i>", "opts": ["competition", "genetic modification", "macroevolution", "trait"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>trait<\/b>: A characteristic of an organism, such as fur colour or beak size. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">性状<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.variation", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The differences in traits among individuals of the same species.”<\/i>", "opts": ["heritable trait", "evolution", "transitional fossil", "variation"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>variation<\/b>: The differences in traits among individuals of the same species. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">变异<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.mutation", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A change in the DNA sequence. It is the original source of new alleles.”<\/i>", "opts": ["mutation", "variation", "heritable trait", "macroevolution"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>mutation<\/b>: A change in the DNA sequence. It is the original source of new alleles. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">突变<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.heritable-trait", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A trait that parents pass to offspring through their genes.”<\/i>", "opts": ["fitness", "heritable trait", "competition", "genetic modification"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>heritable trait<\/b>: A trait that parents pass to offspring through their genes. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">可遗传性状<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.allele", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“One version of a gene.”<\/i>", "opts": ["allele", "mass extinction", "divergent evolution", "selective pressure"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>allele<\/b>: One version of a gene. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">等位基因<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.gene-pool", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“All the alleles found in all the members of a population.”<\/i>", "opts": ["mass extinction", "founder effect", "adaptation", "gene pool"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>gene pool<\/b>: All the alleles found in all the members of a population. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">基因库<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.allele-frequency", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“How common an allele is in a population, as a percentage.”<\/i>", "opts": ["allele frequency", "genetic drift", "bottleneck effect", "evolution"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>allele frequency<\/b>: How common an allele is in a population, as a percentage. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">等位基因频率<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.natural-selection", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Individuals with traits that suit their environment survive and reproduce more, so those traits become more common.”<\/i>", "opts": ["natural selection", "molecular evidence", "gene pool", "fitness"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>natural selection<\/b>: Individuals with traits that suit their environment survive and reproduce more, so those traits become more common. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">自然选择<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u2.t.fitness", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“How well an organism survives and reproduces compared with others of its kind.”<\/i>", "opts": ["homologous structure", "comparative embryology", "evolution", "fitness"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>fitness<\/b>: How well an organism survives and reproduces compared with others of its kind. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">适合度<\/span>", "whys": null}]}